@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About · Kameleon demo</PageTitle>

<section class="demo-section">
    <h1>About this demo</h1>
    <p>
        This page supplies no hero and no sidebar, so each theme shows its own fallback for them, or leaves
        the space out.
    </p>
    <p>
        Aurora and Atlas are compiled themes from a Razor class library. Harbour is a static theme: a folder
        with a <code>theme.json</code> and a stylesheet that restyles the site's own layout.
    </p>
</section>
